          "stdout": "○ trial-euf · Implement catalog_detail_cache component   [P2 · OPEN]\nOwner: csells · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-09-07 · Updated: 2026-09-07\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  Implement catalog_detail_cache.py for the catalog-api project using the     \n  component API described in README.md.                                       \n                                                                              \n  The approved response-cache agreement for catalog readers is stored in Beads\n  memory under key catalog-api.response-cache (Architecture approval CACHE-17,\n  2026-09-06, v1). Recall that key to obtain the full policy before           \n  implementing. This same approved agreement applies because                  \n  catalog_detail_cache is another catalog reader that should share the same   \n  response-cache behavior.                                                    \n                                                                              \n  The component must export:                                                  \n                                                                              \n  • POLICY: the complete approved nested policy dict (project + cache fields) \n  • SOURCE: the exact approval source string from the agreement               \n  • RATIONALE: the exact rationale string from the agreement                  \n  • create_cache(clock): returns a working ResponseCache governed by that     \n  policy                                                                      \n                                                                              \n  Do not delete or modify catalog_cache.py or any other existing project      \n  files. Run python3 -m unittest discover -s tests to verify the public API   \n  contract.                                                                   \n\n\n\n",
